@layout.app()
  @body()
    <div class="w-full flex flex-col mb-4">
      @if (items.length)
        @each(item in items)
          <div
            class="mb-2 w-full h-20 flex justify-between items-center py-2 px-2 transition-colors duration-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 gap-x-2 hover:bg-gray-100 focus:outline-none"
          >
            <div class="w-full h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
              <div class="w-3 h-20" style="background-color: {{ item.tier.color }}">
              </div>
              <img class="object-contain w-1/2 h-14" src="{{ item.displayIcon }}" alt="" />
              <div class="w-20">
                <h1 class="text-sm font-sm text-gray-700 capitalize dark:text-white">
                  {{ item.skinName }}
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
                  {{ item.tier.tierName }}
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col justify-between items-center w-36 h-full">
              <div class="flex flex-row justify-center items-center w-full">
                <p class="text-sm font-sm text-gray-700 capitalize dark:text-white">
                  {{ item.price }}
                </p>
                <img src="{{ currency.currency_icon }}" class="object-contain bg-center z-0 ml-2 h-5" />
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-row justify-between items-center w-28">
                <a href="{{ route('skin', [item.uuid]) }}">
                  <button class="p-1 rounded-lg inline">
                    @svg('heroicons-solid:database', {
                      width: 24,
                      height: 24,
                      color: 'white'
                    })
                  </button>
                </a>
                <div>
                  <button class="p-1 rounded-lg inline bg-green-600">
                    @svg('heroicons:tag', {
                        width: 24,
                        height: 24,
                        color: 'white'
                    })
                  </button>
                </div>
                <div
                  hx-delete="{{ route('user.deleteSkinCookie') }}"
                  hx-vals='{"skin_id": "{{ item.id }}"}'
                  hx-trigger="click once"
                  hx-swap="none"
                >
                  <button class="p-1 rounded-lg inline bg-red-600">
                    @svg('heroicons:trash', {
                      width: 24,
                      height: 24,
                      color: 'white'
                    })
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        @end
        
      @else
        <div class="flex flex-col items-end h-full">
          <img src="https://cdn.answeroverflow.com/1102770704941854750/bongo_omen.GIF" class="w-full" />
          <div class="relative xl:p-4 flex flex-col justify-center items-center">
            <h3
              class="text-6xl bg-gradient-to-r from-night-market via-night-pink-inter to-night-pink inline-block text-transparent bg-clip-text"
              style="font-family: 'VALORANT', sans-serif"
            >
              carrinho
            </h3>
            <p
              class="text-white text-6xl font-bold mb-9 text-center"
              style="font-family: 'VALORANT', sans-serif"
            >
              vazio
            </p>
            <p
              class="
          text-white 
          text-base
          text-body-color
          dark:text-dark-6
          mb-9
          text-justify
          "
            >
              Entre no jogo com estilo! No nosso e-commerce, você pode comprar e vender skins de Valorant de forma fácil e segura. Navegue por uma ampla seleção de itens exclusivos e encontre aquele que combina perfeitamente com seu agente.

        Quer vender suas skins? É só cadastrar e definir seu preço! Conecte-se com outros jogadores e troque suas skins favoritas. Transforme suas jogadas e aproveite o melhor do universo Valorant!
            </p>
            <a
              href="javascript:void(0)"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-night-market px-7 py-[13px] text-center text-base font-medium text-white hover:bg-blue-dark"
            >
              Compre Agora
        </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      @end
    </div>
  @end
@end
